<title>SINGAPORE: Showpla in management reshuffle.</title>
<headline>Showpla in management reshuffle.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Showpla Asia Ltd (SAL) announced on Tuesday a major management reshuffle in a bid to strengthen the group's operations in Singapore and Asia.</p>
<p>Among those affected by the reshuffle were SAL's director and general manager, Masanori Yoshii who with immediate effect becomes exective director of Showpla Technology Centre, the group's research and development base.</p>
<p>SAL is a manufacturer of injection moulded plastics components for consumer electronic and telecommunications industries.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
